{"id":"247282d0ac964dd5","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-ideal.md","title":"Ideal","display":"df-ideal — Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-ideal","aliases":["93-df-ideal"],"display":"df-ideal — Ideal","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ideal — Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is a lattice candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> is the induced order of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is a subset candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Idl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Idl}\\)</span> is the ideal class defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash I\\in\\mathrm{Idl}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land I\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee^{\\mathbf A}b\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(b\\leq_{\\mathbf A}a\\to b\\in I).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash I\\in\\mathrm{Idl}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land I\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee^{\\mathbf A}b\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(b\\leq_{\\mathbf A}a\\to b\\in I).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the lattice ideal dual to <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a>: it is join-closed and downward closed, with all ambient data projected from the lattice argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is a lattice candidate and $\\leq_{\\mathbf A}$ is the induced order of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This is the lattice ideal dual to [[93-df-filter]]: it is join-closed and downward closed, with all ambient data projected from the lattice argument.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Idl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash I\\in\\mathrm{Idl}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land I\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee^{\\mathbf A}b\\in I)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(b\\leq_{\\mathbf A}a\\to b\\in I).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":990,"backlinks":[{"id":"a384ef6e68c1a3dd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fil}$ and $\\mathrm{Idl}$ are the filter and ideal classes of [[93-df-filter]] and [[93-df-ideal]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-ideal]]"}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","3b5f38bd115ed203","9beeac4373d773f8"]}